title: GraphQL Introspection Query Abuse
id: ed76cf40-baaa-4788-bf7f-b869749d0998
status: experimental
description: Detects GraphQL introspection queries (__schema, __type) against production endpoints, which attackers use to enumerate the full API schema, hidden fields, and mutations for further exploitation.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/
logsource:
  category: webserver
detection:
  selection:
    cs-uri-query|contains:
      - '__schema'
      - '__type'
      - 'IntrospectionQuery'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - cs-uri-query
  - cs-uri-stem
  - c-ip
falsepositives:
  - Developer tooling exploring the schema
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1190
